    "answer": "<div style='background-color:#f0fdf4; padding:15px; border-left:5px solid #16a34a; border-radius:8px;'><h4 style='color:#14532d; margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:18px;'>&#10004; ઉકેલ:</h4><div style='background-color:#ffffff; padding:15px; border-radius:5px; border:1px solid #bbf7d0;'><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>ચલ વાળા પદોને ડાબી બાજુ અને અચલ પદોને જમણી બાજુ લેતા:</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>&#8658; x/2 - x/3 = 1/4 + 1/5</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>ડાબી બાજુ લ.સા.અ. 6 અને જમણી બાજુ લ.સા.અ. 20 લેતા:</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>&#8658; (3x - 2x) / 6 = (5 + 4) / 20</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>&#8658; x / 6 = 9 / 20</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>&#8658; x = (9 &times; 6) / 20</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>&#8658; x = 54 / 20</p><div style='display:flex; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-bottom:15px;'><span style='font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'><b>&#8756; x =</b></span><div style='display:inline-block; vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; font-size:16px;'><div style='border-bottom:2px solid #047857; padding:0 5px; color:#047857;'><b>27</b></div><div style='padding:0 5px; color:#1e3a8a;'><b>10</b></div></div></div><div style='border-top:1px dashed #bbf7d0; padding-top:10px;'><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'><b>ચકાસણી:</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:15px; color:#334155;'>ડા.બા. = (27/10)/2 - 1/5 = 27/20 - 4/20 = 23/20</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:15px; color:#334155;'>જ.બા. = (27/10)/3 + 1/4 = 9/10 + 1/4 = (18+5)/20 = 23/20</p><p style='margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'><b>અહીં, ડા.બા. = જ.બા.</b></p></div></div></div>"
