    "answer": "<div style='background-color:#f0fdf4; padding:15px; border-left:5px solid #16a34a; border-radius:8px;'><h4 style='color:#14532d; margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:18px;'>&#10004; ઉકેલ:</h4><div style='background-color:#ffffff; padding:15px; border-radius:5px; border:1px solid #bbf7d0;'><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>ચોકડી ગુણાકાર (Cross Multiplication) કરતા:</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>&#8658; 5(x - 5) = 3(x - 3)</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>કૌંસ છોડતા:</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>&#8658; 5x - 25 = 3x - 9</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>&#8658; 5x - 3x = -9 + 25</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>&#8658; 2x = 16</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'>&#8658; x = 16 / 2</p><p style='margin:0 0 15px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'><b>&#8756; x = 8</b></p><div style='border-top:1px dashed #bbf7d0; padding-top:10px;'><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'><b>ચકાસણી:</b></p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:15px; color:#334155;'>ડા.બા. = (8 - 5) / 3 = 3 / 3 = 1</p><p style='margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:15px; color:#334155;'>જ.બા. = (8 - 3) / 5 = 5 / 5 = 1</p><p style='margin:0; font-size:16px; color:#1e3a8a;'><b>અહીં, ડા.બા. = જ.બા.</b></p></div></div></div>"
